{"id":"5637f628049aa0b47d80efb1d97a463d02341cc9","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1254328","title":"大佬们说说使用 ai 完成的最复杂任务是什么，上线下效果，有没有翻车的","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"i8alexhanhan","excerpt":"程序员 - @i8alexhanhan - 可以分享下，比如处理高并发的，上线后扛住了吗","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>可以分享下，比如处理高并发的，上线后扛住了吗</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n<div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/任务\"><li></li> 任务</a><a href=\"/tag/高并发\"><li></li> 高并发</a></P><p><span>25 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-11-04 18:16:14 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255012\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3b6110eab033c71c28990dff5f463332?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"d29107d\" data-uid=\"560116\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>8</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>游戏上线前，让 ai 查一遍后端，查到不少漏洞，直接延迟上线时间，全力改这些漏洞，也算是避免上线后的损失</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255060\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/17c3/3b21/355796_normal.png?m=1793668932\" alt=\"1024ba\" data-uid=\"355796\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>10</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>目前在 App Store 上架了五款不同类型 App ，还有一款学习英语 App 还在审核中，最初 Ai 味确实很浓，每一次改版都在慢慢进步！现在每一次项目都是 Agents 指挥一个团队在玩，人工只是最终审核成品，翻车情况越来越少了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255091\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3ae7/24e3/631769_normal.png?m=1779938498\" alt=\"liuliuliuliu\" data-uid=\"631769\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>11</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>据我所知，我一个朋友是产品经理，完全用 claude 上线了一个交易所，而且运营中，后面找了 1 个人来维护</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255360\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0b6cd8ff98ea393f17c92eac29efa1c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"chutianyao\" data-uid=\"667494\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>13</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>做了一个点餐小程序,纯前端(后端现成的)<br>还有摄像头上跑推理程序, 部署了几千台,稳定运行 1 一年多</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255574\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7de0/23ec/368519_normal.png?m=1544947487\" alt=\"Seeken\" data-uid=\"368519\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>19</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>从 088 版本把暗影双刀移植到 083 的服务器上，断断续续用了一周多时间，包括让它自己检索资料自己生图补素材等</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255753\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6205287d1945b9a21a06cbdae6b46b04?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"v2zzzzz\" data-uid=\"669758\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>20</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>我觉得做各种 Excel 表格是真轻松了，以前要做各种花里胡哨的表格都是说做不了(确实懒得去研究各种单元格合并，排版)，现在直接让 AI 生成，这种内部导出功能也懒得 review ，出问题也没啥影响</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256516\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/788a/7841/488388_normal.png?m=1589242690\" alt=\"qiuhang\" data-uid=\"488388\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>22</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>嫌弃 ficlash 配置太复杂，而且要手动配置 gfw 名单太死板，自己写了个 trojan 安卓客户端，效果还不错甚至性能和电耗比 ficlash 强点。可惜前段时间 trojan 自建 vps 坠机了，后来换了 hy2 再没用上</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"可以分享下，比如处理高并发的，上线后扛住了吗 AI 任务 高并发2